<title>PHILIPPINES: Music unit raises stake in U.S. firm.</title>
<headline>Music unit raises stake in U.S. firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>MUSIC Semiconductors Corp said on Wednesday its Netherlands-based unit, MUSIC Semiconductors N.V. has acquired an additional 49.99 percent of the issued and outstanding capital stock of U.S.-based New Voice Inc.</p>
<p>MUSIC told the Philippine Stock Exchange that prior to the acquisition, MUSIC N.V. held 50 percent plus one share in New Voice Inc. The acquisition cost was not disclosed.</p>
<p>New Voice is a firm engaged in the design, development and marketing of circuit boards for the telecommunications market.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
